The following files are vendored, with minor path adjustments only, from
`plugmem-coding-core` (version 0.1.0):

  src/vendor/core/adapter.ts
  src/vendor/core/client.ts
  src/vendor/core/config.ts
  src/vendor/core/core.ts
  src/vendor/core/index.ts
