  src/vendor/core/repo_id.ts
  src/vendor/core/transcript.ts
  src/vendor/core/types.ts

Run `npm run sync-core` to refresh them from a local PlugMem checkout.

Local patches applied to the vendored core (all other lines unchanged):

  src/vendor/core/client.ts — healthCheck() used "/health", which omits
  the "/api/v1" prefix the rest of the client uses. Corrected to
  "/api/v1/health".

  src/vendor/core/repo_id.ts — deriveRepoGraphId() emitted ids such as
  "repo://opencode/host/owner/repo", which PlugMem's graph manager
  rejects (names must match [a-zA-Z0-9._-]{3,512}). Now emits
  "repo.opencode.host.owner.repo"; the non-git fallback hashes the path.
  Same identity, legal name.
